                    <p>
                        <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-<supplied reason="lost">k</supplied><unclear>ō</unclear>-<supplied reason="lost">v-i</supplied>rā<hi rend="grantha"><unclear>ja</unclear></hi>-<unclear>kē</unclear><hi rend="grantha">sa</hi>ri-pa<hi rend="grantha">nma</hi>r-āṉa <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-rā<hi rend="grantha">ja</hi>rā<hi rend="grantha">ja-de</hi>varkku yāṇṭu <num value="24">2 <g type="numeral">10</g> 4</num>-Āvatu
                    </p>
                    
                    <p>                        
                        <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>  
                        <milestone type="pagelike" n="B" unit="zone" break="no"/>
                        <lb n="2" break="no"/>-rā<hi rend="grantha">je<supplied reason="omitted">ndra</supplied>-siṃha</hi>-vaḷanāṭṭu maṇṇi-nāṭṭu <hi rend="grantha">brah<unclear>ma</unclear>de</hi>yam Ilacci-kuṭi-y-ākiya vikrama-ciṅka-c-catu<hi rend="grantha"><reg>r</reg>v<unclear reason="eccentric_ductus">v</unclear>edi</hi>-maṅkalattu c<unclear>i</unclear>va-purattu nākiyaṇṇa-<hi rend="grantha">kra</hi>mavit=taṉum vātāvi Ā<hi rend="grantha">di</hi>t=ta-<hi rend="grantha">kra</hi>mavittaṉum <unclear cert="low">Uḷḷuppāḻatēviya</unclear>-<hi rend="grantha">kra</hi>mavittaṉum vātāvi <hi rend="grantha">śrī-<supplied reason="omitted">kṛ</supplied>ṣṇa-kra</hi>mavittaṉūm Ivvaṉaivōm Uḷḷiṭṭa <hi rend="grantha">sa<supplied reason="lost">bh</supplied>ai</hi> <gap reason="lost" quantity="8" unit="character"/> <unclear>nāṭṭu-t tirai</unclear>m<choice><orig><unclear>u</unclear></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>r-nāṭṭ<unclear>u</unclear> <hi rend="grantha"><unclear reason="eccentric_ductus">bra</unclear>h<unclear>m</unclear>ade</hi>yam cāttāṉūr-t tiru-v-āvaṭu-tuṟai Uṭaiya <hi rend="grantha">parama-s<unclear>v</unclear>ā</hi>mikku Ā<hi rend="grantha"><unclear reason="eccentric_ductus">di</unclear>-dāsa</hi>ṉ-ākiya <hi rend="grantha">tribhu</hi>vaṉa-<hi rend="grantha"><choice><sic>ś</sic><corr>c</corr></choice>aṇḍeśvara-de</hi>varkku Oṭṭi-k kai-t-t<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ṭṭu Oṭṭu-k kuṭutta paric’ āvatu</p>
                    
                    <p>
                        Eṅkaḷūr It-tiru-v-āvaṭu-tuṟai Uṭaiya ma<hi rend="grantha">hāde</hi>var paḻam paṭi Uṭaiya n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>r-nilam <g type="numeral">1/2</g>
                    </p>
                    
                    <p>                    
                        In-ni
                        <milestone type="pagelike" n="C" unit="zone" break="no"/>
                        <lb n="3"/><surplus>ṉ</surplus>lam Araikkum
                        <list>
                            <item>k<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ḻ-pārk’ ellai <hi rend="grantha">sabhai</hi>-p potuvukku mēkkum</item>
                            <item>teṉ-pāṟk’ ellai <hi rend="grantha">trai</hi>lō<hi rend="grantha">kkya</hi>-ma<hi rend="grantha">hā-de</hi>v<choice><orig><supplied reason="lost">i</supplied></orig><reg>ī</reg></choice><unclear>maṅ</unclear>kalattu-t tiru-p-pal<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice><hi rend="grantha">śva</hi>ram uṭaiya ma<hi rend="grantha">hāde</hi>var nilattukku vaṭakkum</item>
                            <item>mēl-pāṟk’ ellai vaṭakkoṭiṇṇāṟṟukku kiḻakkum</item>
                            <item>vaṭa-pāṟk’ ellai Ik-kaṇāṟṟukkē tērkum</item>
                        </list>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Ivv-icaitta peru-nāṉk’ ellai-Ilum Akapp<choice><sic>i</sic><corr>a</corr></choice>ṭa nilam Eṅkaḷ<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>r <unclear>Ū</unclear><supplied reason="lost">r-a</supplied>ḷavu kōlāl <choice><orig>ṉ</orig><reg>n</reg></choice>ūṟu kuḻi koṇṭatu Oru mā-v āka van=ta nilaṉ <g type="numeral">1/2</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Iṉ-ṉila<unclear>m</unclear>Araiyum m<supplied reason="lost">i</supplied>kut<supplied reason="lost">i</supplied>-k kuṟaimai Uḷḷ atāṅka <unclear>nila</unclear>m pattu māvum
                        Uṇṇ<supplied reason="lost">i</supplied>lam Oḻiv’ iṉṟiyē Iṉ-ṉilam muṉpu <hi rend="grantha">de</hi>var itē Ātaṉmai<lb n="4" break="no"/>Il <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-rā<hi rend="grantha">ja</hi>rā<hi rend="grantha">ja-de</hi>var Ulak-aḷan=t-aruḷi Iṟai y-eṟi<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>a pi<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>pu Itukku Iṟai-kāval āka
                        It-tē var pakkal nāṅkaḷ muṉpu koṇṭa po<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> kuṭukka māṭṭāmaiyil Innilattāl van=ta Iṟai-y<unclear>u</unclear>m Eccōṟum veṭṭi-vētiṉaikaḷum maṟṟu <hi rend="grantha">sābhai</hi> y-iṭu vari-p-pāṭum ce<choice><orig>nn</orig><reg>ṉṉ</reg></choice><choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>r-veṭṭiyum tirukkoṟa-vācalil pōn=ta kuṭimai Eppērppaṭṭatum <hi rend="grantha">sabhai</hi>yōmē Iṉ-ṉāṅku <hi rend="grantha">si</hi>mai-Ilum Akappaṭṭa nilattukku Iṟai Iṟuttu-k kāttu-k kuṭuppat’ ākavum
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Ip-poṉ tiruvaiyāṟṟu-maṭam-uṭaiya <hi rend="grantha">sadā</hi>civa<hi rend="grantha">bha</hi>ṭār Irun=tu It-tēvar kāmmikaḷai Iṭṭu Ip-poṉ taravallirkaḷō Eṉṟu kēḻkka nāṅkaḷ Ip-poṉ kuṭukka māṭ<lb n="5" break="no"/>ṭāmaiyil Ip-poṉṉukku-p palicai cekuttu In-nilattukku Ip-paricu Eppērpaṭṭa Iṟaiyum Iṟuttu It-<hi rend="grantha">de</hi>var Iṟai-y-ili Aṉupavikka Oṭṭi-k k<choice><sic>a</sic><corr>ai</corr></choice>-t-t<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ṭṭu Iṭṭu-k kuṭuttōm tiruvāṭutuṟai y-uṭ<unclear>ai</unclear>ya parama-<hi rend="grantha">svā</hi>mikku Ā<hi rend="grantha">di-dāsa</hi><choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>-ākiya <hi rend="grantha">tribhu</hi>va<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>a-caṇṭē<hi rend="grantha">śva</hi>ra-<hi rend="grantha">de</hi>varkku Ilacci-kuṭi-y-ākiya vi<hi rend="grantha">kra</hi>ma-ciṅka-c-catu<hi rend="grantha">rvvedi</hi>-maṅkalattu <hi rend="grantha">sabhai</hi>yōm
                    </p>
                    <p>Itaṟ ṟiṟampiṉārai pēr-p poṉ <choice><orig>ṉ</orig><reg>n</reg></choice>ūṟṟu-k kaḻañcu poṉ maṉṟa-p peṟuvat’ ākavu<choice><orig>mm</orig><reg>m</reg></choice>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        aṉṟiyum It-<hi rend="grantha">de</hi>varē Iṉ-ṉilam Ip-paricu Iṟ<choice><orig>ai-I</orig><reg>ai-y-i</reg></choice>li Aṉupavikka-p peṟuva<unclear>t’ ākavum</unclear>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Ip-paric’ oṭṭi-k kai-t-t<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ṭṭu Iṭṭu-k kuṭuttōm tiruv<unclear>ā</unclear>vaṭutuṟai-y-uṭ<hi rend="grantha">ai</hi>ya parama<hi rend="grantha">svā</hi>mikku m<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>la<hi rend="grantha">bhṛtya</hi>r-ākiya <hi rend="grantha">tribhu</hi>va<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>a-<hi rend="grantha"><choice><sic>ś</sic><corr>c</corr></choice>aṇḍeśva</hi>ra-<hi rend="grantha">de</hi>varkku Ilaccu-kuṭi-y-ākiya vi<hi rend="grantha">kra</hi>ma-ciṅka<lb n="6" break="no"/>-c-catu<hi rend="grantha">rvvedi</hi>maṅkalattu <hi rend="grantha">sabhai</hi>yōm
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <hi rend="grantha">sabhai</hi>yuḷḷ eḻuttu
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        civa-purattu nākiyaṇṇa-<hi rend="grantha">kra</hi>ma-vittaṉum vātāvi Ā<hi rend="grantha">di</hi>t=ta-<hi rend="grantha">kra</hi>mavit=taṉum paṇiyāl
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <hi rend="grantha">kṣatri</hi>ya<hi rend="grantha">śi</hi>kāmaṇi vaḷa-nāṭṭu-p paṉ<unclear>ai</unclear>y<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>r-nāṭṭu-t <hi rend="grantha">de</hi>va<hi rend="grantha">dā</hi>ṉam Iṟ<choice><orig>ai-I</orig><reg>ai-y-i</reg></choice>li <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-pukalūr ma<hi rend="grantha">hāde</hi>var paṇṭāra-k-karaṇattāṉ Iṉ-ṉāṭṭu <hi rend="grantha">brahmade</hi>yam kākkai-maṅkalattu <hi rend="grantha">sabhai</hi> y-iṭu karaṇattāṉ vēḻakkōvaṉ <hi rend="grantha">grā</hi>man <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-rākavaṉ-ēṉ Ivai-y e<choice><orig>ṉṉ</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> eḻuttu
                    </p>
                    <list>
                        <item>
                            Ip-paṭi Aṟivēṉ Uyya-k-koṇṭār-vaḷanāṭṭu-p pērāvūr-nāṭṭu-c ciṟu-puliyūr vākkiyan pa<unclear>ra</unclear>me<hi rend="grantha">śva</hi>raṉ pāṇṭa<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>-ē<unclear>ṉ</unclear>
                        </item>
                        <item>Ip-paṭi Aṟivēṉ teṉ-karai-p-pāṇṭikulācaṉi-vaḷanāṭṭu <hi rend="grantha">brahmade</hi>yam ci-kaṇṭa-c-catu<hi rend="grantha">rvvedi</hi>-maṅkalattu ma<hi rend="grantha"><choice><sic>tsy</sic><corr>dhy</corr></choice>as<supplied reason="omitted">t</supplied>a</hi>n Āyirava<supplied reason="omitted">ṉ</supplied> U<hi rend="grantha">da</hi>ya<hi rend="grantha">di</hi> vākāṉ-ā<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>a civa-patta<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>-ē<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>
                        </item>
                        <item>
                            <supplied reason="omitted">Ip-paṭi Aṟivēṉ</supplied> Uyyak⌈<lb n="7" break="no"/>koṇtār-vaḷanāṭṭu-p pērāvūr-nāṭṭu-p pira<supplied reason="omitted">ma</supplied>tēyam ciṟu-puliyūr ma<hi rend="grantha"><choice><sic>tsy</sic><corr>dhy</corr></choice>asta</hi><choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> <hi rend="check"><num value="40"><unclear reason="eccentric_ductus">5</unclear> <g type="numeral">100</g> 4 <g type="numeral">10</g></num> ti<supplied reason="omitted">ṟ</supplied>man kāṉṉ-ēṉ</hi>
                        </item>
                        <item>
                            Ip-paṭi Aṟivē<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> pērāvūr-nāṭṭu-p piramatēyam ciṟupuliyūr kāccavaṉ nārāya<supplied reason="lost">ṇa</supplied><choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> <unclear>m</unclear>ātava<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>-ē<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>
                        </item>
                        <item>
                            Ip-paṭi Aṟivē<unclear>ṉ</unclear> teṉ-karai-p pāṇṭikulācani-vaḷanāṭṭu-p piramatēyam c<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>-kaṇṭa-c-catu<hi rend="grantha">rvvedi</hi>-maṅkalattu civa-p-pirāmaṇa<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> nakkaṉ Āyirapaṭṭa<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>-ē<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>
