                <div type="textpart" xml:lang="tam-Latn" rendition="class:tamil maturity:83215" n="B">
                    <head xml:lang="eng">Second Part: year 25 of Rājendra</head>
                    <p>
                        I<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>ṟum It-tēvarkē yāṇṭu <num value="25">2 <g type="numeral">10</g> 5</num>-Āvatu</p>
                    <p>
                        U<supplied reason="omitted">y</supplied>ya-k-koṇṭār-vaḷanāṭṭu-p pērāvūr-nāṭṭu Iḷaṅkāri-kuṭi Ūrōm In-nāṭṭu-t tiraim<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice><supplied reason="omitted">r</supplied>-nāṭṭu-t tiruvāva<supplied reason="omitted">ṭu</supplied>tuṟai ma<hi rend="grantha">hāde</hi>varkku nāṅkaḷ ca<hi rend="grantha">ndrādi</hi>t=tavaṟ tiru-non=tā-viḷakku 1 ṉukku Erippataṟku-k kuṭutta nila<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> <g type="numeral">1/4</g></p>
                    <p>
                        In-nilam kālukkum 
                        <list>
                            <item>k<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ḻ-pārk’ ellai Ivv-ūr nilattukku mērkum</item>
                            <item>teṉ-pārk’ ellai kiḷanallūr-vāykālukkum It-tēva-caṇṭai-paṅkuk=kum vaṭakkum</item>
                            <item>m<unclear>ē</unclear>l-pāṟk’ ellai-y <hi rend="grantha">brahmade</hi>yam ciru-puliyūr nilattuk=ku kiḻakkum</item>
                            <item>vaṭa-pā<surplus>pa</surplus>ṟk’ ellai Ivv-iḷaṅkāri-kuṭi nilattukku teṟkum</item>
                        </list>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Ivv-icaitta peru nāṉk’ ellaiyilum Akappaṭṭa nila<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> kālum Uḷḷi <choice><sic>ṇ</sic><corr>n</corr></choice>i<lb n="9" break="no"/>lam oḻiv’ iṉṟi Iṟai-y-ili-y-āka-c ca<hi rend="grantha">ndrādi</hi>t=tavaṟ Iṟai-y-ili ceytu kuṭuttōm Ivv-iḷaṅkāriki Ūrōm
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        In-nilaṅ kāluṅ koṇṭu It-tiru-vāvaṭutuṟai <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-kōyil Uṭaiyār<unclear>k</unclear> <space quantity="15" unit="character" type="vacat"/>
                        pparic’ oṭṭi In-nilam Iṟai-Ili-y-āka-c ceytu <supplied reason="omitted">ku</supplied>ṭuttōm tiru-vāvaṭuturai ma<hi rend="grantha">hāde</hi>varkku Iḷaṅkāri-kuṭi Ūrōm
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        In-nilam kallilum cempilum veṭṭi-k koḷḷa-p peṟuvār ākavum
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Ip-paricu Ivv-ā<supplied reason="omitted">va</supplied>ṇam Eḻutiṉē<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> Ivv-ūṟ-k karaṇattā<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> vēḷ kōvaṉ kāṟaṉimpaṭṭa<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>-ē<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> Ivai-y e<choice><orig>ṉn</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> eḻuttu <g ref="sym:flourish-taperOut" type="punctuation">.</g>
                    </p>
                </div> 
                
